     `mgdb-table-wrap`, which is defined in no stylesheet, so they were not
     scroll containers at all and the page overflowed to 1,016px on a 375px
     phone. Same silent-failure family as `mgdb-table-wrapper` and
     `mgdb-chart-tall`: grep src/css/ before trusting a wrapper class.
     Fixed 2026-09-05. -->
